      "side": 1,
      "message": "Also, the broken scheduling would be evident in Perfetto traces, so please use them to validate your changes in the future:\n\nhttps://perfetto.dev/docs/data-sources/frametimeline",
      "parentUuid": "78f8eb70_d69d58cb",
